\bigskip

\textbf{Project Objective:}

The objective of this project is to actively engage in community service at ISKCON Temple, Bengaluru by providing care, support, and assistance in organizational and social service activities. The initiative aims to practice Universal Human Values such as Compassion, Responsibility, Cooperation, Affection, and Gratitude through meaningful interaction and contribution to community welfare programs.

\bigskip

\textbf{Planned Activities:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Assisting in organizing community service activities.
    \item Volunteering in food distribution (Annadanam) services.
    \item Supporting administrative or organizational tasks.
    \item Interacting respectfully with beneficiaries and staff.
\end{itemize}

\bigskip

\textbf{Expected Outcomes:}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Practical understanding of Compassion and Responsibility.
    \item Development of teamwork and cooperation.
    \item Enhanced awareness of interconnectedness within society.
\end{itemize}

