\section{Challenges \& Solutions}

\vspace{0.5cm}

\textbf{Challenge:}  
During our visit, the temple was experiencing a festive day rush, which resulted in a large crowd. Due to this, the team had to wait longer than expected to interact with the priest. Managing time, maintaining coordination, and ensuring proper discipline in a crowded environment became challenging.

\vspace{0.2cm}

\textbf{Challenges Faced:}
\begin{itemize}
\item Delay in interaction due to heavy festive crowd
\item Difficulty in coordinating team movement in crowded space
\item Limited time availability of priest
\item Managing patience while waiting
\item Maintaining discipline without causing disturbance
\end{itemize}

\vspace{0.2cm}

\textbf{Solution using UHV Principles:}
\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Patience:} The team calmly waited for the right opportunity
\item \textbf{Cooperation:} Members supported each other and stayed coordinated
\item \textbf{Respect:} Maintained silence and respected temple environment
\item \textbf{Responsibility:} Ensured no inconvenience to visitors or staff
\item \textbf{Understanding:} Accepted the situation and adapted accordingly
\end{itemize}

